          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సమాధి (samādhi) is borrowed from Sanskrit samādhi (Monier-Williams), whose first sense is \"putting together, joining\"; in Telugu it names a tomb."
            }
          ]
        },
